        "candidate_id": "C_e6e500dd50a03157_2",
        "edit": "Fix load/shift condition: replace the redundant `if (rstn)` with `if (load_en)` so load only occurs when load_en is asserted. In the shift branch, limit the loop to i<7 to avoid out-of-range op[8], and shift in 0 at op[0] instead of wrapping op[7].",
